PROJECT: Cardano
Official Name: Cardano (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation, https://cardano.org]
Symbol: ADA (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation, https://cardano.org]
Category: Layer 1 Blockchain / Smart Contract Platform / Proof-of-Stake Blockchain (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation, https://cardano.org; Messari, https://messari.io/asset/cardano]
Founding Entity: Input Output Global (IOG) — yurisdiksi Hong Kong; Cardano Foundation — yurisdiksi Swiss (Zug); Emurgo — yurisdiksi Jepang (HIGH) [IOG, https://inputoutput.io; Cardano Foundation, https://cardanofoundation.org; Emurgo, https://emurgo.io]
Founders: Charles Hoskinson (Co-founder, CEO IOG); Jeremy Wood (Co-founder, CSO IOG) (HIGH) [IOG Team Page, https://inputoutput.io/team/; Forbes Profile Charles Hoskinson, https://www.forbes.com/profile/charles-hoskinson/]
Core Team: Terdiri dari tiga entitas pengembang utama — Input Output Global (penelitian & pengembangan protokol inti, >400 karyawan), Cardano Foundation (standarisasi, ekosistem, tata kelola, >50 karyawan), Emurgo (adopsi komersial & venture building, >100 karyawan) — total ratusan insinyur & peneliri terdistribusi global (HIGH) [IOG About, https://inputoutput.io; Cardano Foundation Annual Report 2023, https://cardanofoundation.org; Emurgo About, https://emurgo.io]
Country: Global (Kantor empu operasional: Swiss/Zug untuk Foundation; Hong Kong untuk IOG; Tokyo/Singapura untuk Emurgo) (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation Contact, https://cardanofoundation.org/contact/; IOG Contact, https://inputoutput.io/contact/; Emurgo Locations, https://emurgo.io/company/]
Launch Date - Testnet: Testnet Ouroboros Classic (Era Byron) peluncuran publik Oktober 2017; Testnet pra-mainnet internal (K-Era) beroperasi Maret 2017 (HIGH) [IOG Blog "Cardano Testnet Launch", https://iohk.io/en/blog/posts/2017/10/02/cardano-testnet-launch/; IOG Blog "Cardano Settlement Layer", https://iohk.io/en/blog/posts/2017/03/29/cardano-settlement-layer/]
Launch Date - Mainnet: 29 September 2017 (Era Byron, peluncuran Mainnet resmi) (HIGH) [IOG Blog "Cardano Mainnet Launch", https://iohk.io/en/blog/posts/2017/09/29/cardano-mainnet-launch/; CoinGecko History, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/cardano]
Launch Date - TGE: Penjualan voucher ADA (ICO) berlangsung September 2015 – Januari 2017 di bawah entitas yang berbeda (Attain Alternative Strategies Ltd, Swiss); Token ADA menjadi aktif & transferable on-chain sejak Mainnet launch 29 September 2017 (HIGH) [Cardano Roadmap Archives "Byron", https://roadmap.cardano.org/en/byron/; Messari "Cardano Launch & Token Distribution", https://messari.io/report/cardano-launch-and-token-distribution]
Main Products: Cardano Blockchain (Layer 1 Settlement & Computation Layer) (HIGH) [Cardano Architecture, https://docs.cardano.org/architecture]; Ouroboros (Famili Protokol Konsensus Proof-of-Stake: Classic, BFT, Praos, Genesis, Chronos, Leios, Peras) (HIGH) [IOG Research Library Ouroboros, https://iohk.io/en/research/library/]; Plutus (Platform Smart Contract berbasis Haskell/eUTXO) (HIGH) [Plutus Docs, https://docs.cardano.org/plutus/]; Marlowe (Domain-Specific Language untuk Kontrak Keuangan) (HIGH) [Marlowe Docs, https://docs.cardano.org/marlowe/]; Hydra (Protocol Skalabilitas Layer 2 Isomorphic State Channels) (HIGH) [Hydra Docs, https://hydra.family/]; Midnight (Partner Chain Berbasis Data Protection/Privacy, menggunakan Zero-Knowledge Proofs) (HIGH) [Midnight Announcement, https://iohk.io/en/blog/posts/2022/11/18/introducing-midnight/]; Prism (Solusi Identitas Desentralisasi / DID) (HIGH) [Prism/Atala PRISM, https://atalaprism.io/]; Project Catalyst (Tata Kelola On-chain & Dana Inovasi Komunitas) (HIGH) [Project Catalyst, https://cardano.ideascale.com/]
Official Website: https://cardano.org (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation, https://cardano.org]
Repository: https://github.com/input-output-hk (Organisasi GitHub utama IOG) (HIGH) [IOG GitHub, https://github.com/input-output-hk]; https://github.com/CardanoFoundation (Foundation) (HIGH) [CF GitHub, https://github.com/CardanoFoundation]; https://github.com/Emurgo (Emurgo) (HIGH) [Emurgo GitHub, https://github.com/Emurgo]
Documentation: https://docs.cardano.org (Portal Dokumentasi Resmi Terpadu) (HIGH) [Cardano Docs, https://docs.cardano.org]; https://developers.cardano.org (Portal Pengembang) (HIGH) [Cardano Developers, https://developers.cardano.org]
Social - X/Twitter: @Cardano (Resmi Foundation); @InputOutputHK (IOG); @Emurgo_io (Emurgo) (HIGH) [Cardano.org Footer Links, https://cardano.org]
Social - Discord: https://discord.gg/cardano (Server Resmi Komunitas & Dukungan) (HIGH) [Cardano.org Footer Links, https://cardano.org]
Social - Telegram: @CardanoOfficial (Channel Announcement Resmi); @CardanoCommunity (Grup Diskusi) (HIGH) [Cardano.org Footer Links, https://cardano.org]
Block Explorer: https://explorer.cardano.org (Explorer Resmi Foundation/IOG); https://cardanoscan.io (Explorer Populer Komunitas); https://adastat.net (Analytics & Explorer); https://cexplorer.io (Blockfrost/Community) (HIGH) [Cardano.org Ecosystem Links, https://cardano.org/ecosystem/]
Token Contract: Aset asli (native asset) pada chain Cardano — tidak menggunakan alamat kontrak smart contract (ERC-20 style); ADA adalah token fee & staking native protocol; Policy ID: (tidak berlaku/native) (HIGH) [Cardano Native Tokens Docs, https://docs.cardano.org/native-tokens/; CIP-14 User-Facing Asset Fingerprint, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip14/]
Chain(s): Cardano Mainnet; Testnet Preprod (Staging); Testnet Preview (Development); Partner Chain: Midnight (Sidechain/Partner Chain berbasis Polkadot SDK/ZK) (HIGH) [Cardano Network Parameters, https://docs.cardano.org/operating-a-stake-pool/network-parameters/; Midnight Docs, https://midnight.network/]
Ecosystem: Ekosistem Cardano mencakup: DeFi (Minswap, Indigo Protocol, Liqwid Finance, WingRiders, DexHunter); Staking/Liquid Staking (Lido på Cardano - tidak ada, gunakan: DexHunter, Lenfi, Indigo); NFT/Marketplace (JPG Store, The Ape Society, Clay Mates); Wallet (Lace - resmi IOG, Eternl, Vespr, Typhon, Nami, Yoroi - Emurgo, Daedalus - IOG Full Node); Infrastructure/Oracles (Blockfrost, Koios, MeshJS, Charli3, Orcfax); Real World Assets / Identity (Atala PRISM, IAMX); Governance Tools (Cardano Governance Portal, GovTool, Pool.pm) (HIGH) [Cardano Ecosystem Map, https://cardano.org/ecosystem/; DefiLlama Cardano, https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano; Cardano Cube, https://cardanocube.io/]

Open Threads
- Tanggal pasti peluncuran "Testnet K-Era" internal Maret 2017 vs peluncuran testnet publik Oktober 2017 perlu diselaraskan dengan satu definisi "Testnet Launch" yang baku untuk dossier.
- Status yuridik "Founding Entity" tunggal: apakah dossier mengacu pada IOG (pembangun teknis), Cardano Foundation (pemegang merek/tata kelola), atau konsorsium tri-entitas — memengaruhi field Country & Founding Entity.
- Ukuran tim inti (core team) per entitas (IOG, CF, Emurgo) per kuartal terbaru (Q1/Q2 2025) belum terverifikasi dari laporan tahunan terbaru.
- Definisi TGE yang kanonikal untuk ADA: apakah tanggal berakhirnya penjualan voucher (Jan 2017), tanggal snapshot distribusi, atau tanggal mainnet live (29 Sep 2017) — sumber berbeda menggunakan definisi berbeda.
- Daftar ekosistem di atas bersifat snapshot; perlu mekanisme pembaruan berkala untuk akuransi fase berikutnya.